-19.3.0 (2019-10-15)
--------------------
-
-Changes
-^^^^^^^
-
-- Fixed ``auto_attribs`` usage when default values cannot be compared directly with ``==``, such as ``numpy`` arrays.
-  `#585 <https://github.com/python-attrs/attrs/issues/585>`_
-
