-17.2.0 (2017-05-24)
--------------------
-
-
-Changes:
-^^^^^^^^
-
-- Validators are hashable again.
-  Note that validators may become frozen in the future, pending availability of no-overhead frozen classes.
-  `#192 <https://github.com/python-attrs/attrs/issues/192>`_
